{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knitewings\u2122</strong> is a high-speed on-rails shooter where four angelic <strong>sisters</strong> battle against demonic legions across vibrant, fantastical landscapes. Inspired by arcade classics and enhanced with <strong>roguelite progression</strong>, Knitewings\u2122 blends lightning-fast action, strategic on-the-fly upgrades, and cinematic intensity into a unique arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every battle lies a greater war: the Song that holds the universe together is fading, and the Silence rises to break it. Four angelic warrior sisters take flight to defend the balance.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up (on the fly)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a <strong>Gift</strong>, build a synergy, and feel the power spike.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your angel \u2014 <strong>Michela, Gabriela, Raffaela, or Uriela</strong> \u2014 each with a distinct melee style, stat profile, and playstyle. Equip a powerful primary weapon and an auto-targeting secondary, then dive into dynamic stages filled with enemy waves, flying hazards, and epic multi-phase boss battles. <strong>Finish close threats with a forward melee lunge</strong> (and, with precise timing, <strong>parry boss dash attacks</strong>), unleash <strong>elemental Specials</strong>, and customize your run with randomized <strong>Gifts</strong> and synergies.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forward Melee Lunge \u2014 Finisher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish close, high-HP enemies before they exit the screen.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a test of reflex and adaptability: destroy enemies to collect <strong>XP</strong> and level up, unlock randomized upgrades <strong>on the fly</strong>, and gather coins to unlock new characters and permanent enhancements. With <strong>two support system slots</strong> and dozens of combinations, no two runs are ever the same.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry \u2014 Boss Dash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise timing, <strong>parry</strong> incoming boss dash attacks to create space.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Four Playable Sisters:</strong> Michela (Water), Gabriela (Fire), Raffaela (Earth), Uriela (Air) \u2014 distinct melee styles, stat profiles, elemental Specials, and unlockable upgrades.<br></li><li><strong>Rail-Shooter Gameplay:</strong> classic forward-scrolling arcade action with full movement inside the camera frame and crisp pattern readability.<br></li><li><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> earn XP to unlock randomized upgrades on the fly; keep coins for permanent enhancements and character unlocks.<br></li><li><strong>Flexible Loadouts:</strong> equip one primary and one auto-targeting secondary per run; weapons level up and can be swapped or recovered without losing progress.<br></li><li><strong>Forward Melee Lunge:</strong> precise close-range strike to <strong>finish high-HP enemies</strong> before they exit\u2014and, with perfect timing, to <strong>parry boss dash attacks</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Support Systems:</strong> up to two automatic supports\u2014shields, orbitals, lightning fields\u2014that level up and adapt to your build.<br></li><li><strong>Boss Fights &amp; Enemy Waves:</strong> screen-filling bullet patterns, coordinated formations, and epic multi-phase bosses that test both reflex and strategy.<br></li><li><strong>Replayability &amp; Rewards:</strong> bonus coins and chests for perfect wave clears and stylish play; deep meta progression for high replay value.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Specials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash screen-sweeping abilities for each sister (Water \u2022 Fire \u2022 Earth \u2022 Air).</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soar through the skies, unleash divine fury, and prove yourself in the war between heaven and hell. Your wings are your weapon. Your destiny awaits.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729530?t=1773780893","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729530?t=1773780893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/7ea120f162b0a50f32c56d4840b34d4a58d5c57b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773780893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/7ea120f162b0a50f32c56d4840b34d4a58d5c57b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773780893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game features stylized fantasy combat in a non-realistic setting, as well as anime-inspired character designs that include revealing fantasy outfits. There is no nudity, sexual acts, or sexual themes. While not graphic or explicit, these elements may not be suitable for younger audiences."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4358490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knitewings\u2122</strong> is a high-speed on-rails shooter where four angelic <strong>sisters</strong> battle against demonic legions across vibrant, fantastical landscapes. Inspired by arcade classics and enhanced with <strong>roguelite progression</strong>, Knitewings\u2122 blends lightning-fast action, strategic on-the-fly upgrades, and cinematic intensity into a unique arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every battle lies a greater war: the Song that holds the universe together is fading, and the Silence rises to break it. Four angelic warrior sisters take flight to defend the balance.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up (on the fly)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a <strong>Gift</strong>, build a synergy, and feel the power spike.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/499605c4293fdf450a00e33a1b17515a.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your angel \u2014 <strong>Michela, Gabriela, Raffaela, or Uriela</strong> \u2014 each with a distinct melee style, stat profile, and playstyle. Equip a powerful primary weapon and an auto-targeting secondary, then dive into dynamic stages filled with enemy waves, flying hazards, and epic multi-phase boss battles. <strong>Finish close threats with a forward melee lunge</strong> (and, with precise timing, <strong>parry boss dash attacks</strong>), unleash <strong>elemental Specials</strong>, and customize your run with randomized <strong>Gifts</strong> and synergies.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forward Melee Lunge \u2014 Finisher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish close, high-HP enemies before they exit the screen.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/0bda054b3595442aec2cee09970f3426.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a test of reflex and adaptability: destroy enemies to collect <strong>XP</strong> and level up, unlock randomized upgrades <strong>on the fly</strong>, and gather coins to unlock new characters and permanent enhancements. With <strong>two support system slots</strong> and dozens of combinations, no two runs are ever the same.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry \u2014 Boss Dash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise timing, <strong>parry</strong> incoming boss dash attacks to create space.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/353dc7b9a194340ce883d5422054232d.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Four Playable Sisters:</strong> Michela (Water), Gabriela (Fire), Raffaela (Earth), Uriela (Air) \u2014 distinct melee styles, stat profiles, elemental Specials, and unlockable upgrades.<br></li><li><strong>Rail-Shooter Gameplay:</strong> classic forward-scrolling arcade action with full movement inside the camera frame and crisp pattern readability.<br></li><li><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> earn XP to unlock randomized upgrades on the fly; keep coins for permanent enhancements and character unlocks.<br></li><li><strong>Flexible Loadouts:</strong> equip one primary and one auto-targeting secondary per run; weapons level up and can be swapped or recovered without losing progress.<br></li><li><strong>Forward Melee Lunge:</strong> precise close-range strike to <strong>finish high-HP enemies</strong> before they exit\u2014and, with perfect timing, to <strong>parry boss dash attacks</strong>.<br></li><li><strong>Support Systems:</strong> up to two automatic supports\u2014shields, orbitals, lightning fields\u2014that level up and adapt to your build.<br></li><li><strong>Boss Fights &amp; Enemy Waves:</strong> screen-filling bullet patterns, coordinated formations, and epic multi-phase bosses that test both reflex and strategy.<br></li><li><strong>Replayability &amp; Rewards:</strong> bonus coins and chests for perfect wave clears and stylish play; deep meta progression for high replay value.</li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Specials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash screen-sweeping abilities for each sister (Water \u2022 Fire \u2022 Earth \u2022 Air).</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.poster.avif?t=1773780893\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.webm?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/extras/c3d4da45c796cafb15d0f54c4ac25a8c.mp4?t=1773780893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soar through the skies, unleash divine fury, and prove yourself in the war between heaven and hell. Your wings are your weapon. Your destiny awaits.</strong></p>","developers":["Profenix Studio SRLS"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/62d8d42d04a46b5d5cfbdd85a97e6a1f2cead413/header.jpg?t=1773780893","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729530/192207806/eb072d92860a864f946b7d6b601c007ada599ba5/1770164623/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770165533","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729530/192207806/eb072d92860a864f946b7d6b601c007ada599ba5/1770164623/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770165533","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729530/192207806/eb072d92860a864f946b7d6b601c007ada599ba5/1770164623/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770165533","id":257278862,"name":"Knitewings\u2122 Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257278862/c2b203c8c108cffdaad8ffe83d1fba2fc988cde8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770165533"}],"name":"Knitewings\u2122","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1500X / Intel Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 550 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> \u26a0\ufe0f Knitewings\u2122 requires a GPU compatible with OpenGL 4.5 or higher. The game is optimized for dedicated graphics cards. On some integrated GPUs, performance may be insufficient or graphical issues may occur. For stable 30fps at 900p on low-end systems, we recommend lowering the resolution (e.g., to 70%) and disabling advanced visual effects.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 / Intel Core i5-9400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 580 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Designed for 60fps gameplay at 1080p with medium to high graphics settings. A dedicated GPU with full OpenGL 4.5 support is strongly recommended for optimal performance and visual quality.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Profenix Studio SRLS"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/adae288264f70d63c5300faaf5b8dea13ebf6d66/ss_adae288264f70d63c5300faaf5b8dea13ebf6d66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773780893","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729530/adae288264f70d63c5300faaf5b8dea13ebf6d66/ss_adae288264f70d63c5300faaf5b8dea13ebf6d66.600x338.jpg?t=1773780893"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.ste